=== claude-code/basic ===
No flags.

=== codex/basic ===
No flags.

=== claude-code/resume-cold ===
[cold-resume] turns=3 (122,110 tokens, measured)
  Resumed request on turn 3 after a 45m idle gap rewrote 122,110 of 122,150 prompt tokens (99%) into cache.
  evidence: gap=45m (2,700s), P=122,150 (measured), rewritten=122,110 (measured, 99%), trigger=resume_after_idle_gap; see https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/issues/100447

=== claude-code/near-full-context ===
[near-full-context] turns=2..=5 (724,560 tokens, measured)
  4 consecutive requests on turns 2..=5 ran at up to 95% of the 200,000-token context window, resending 724,560 prompt tokens.
  evidence: turns=2..=5 (4 requests), model=claude-sonnet-4-5, window=200,000 (catalog), peak_P=190,205 (measured, 95%), tokens_resent=724,560 (measured), cache_read=548,385 (measured)

=== claude-code/tool-bloat ===
[tool-output-bloat] turns=2..=5 (120,000 tokens, estimated: utf8_bytes_div4_ceil_scaled)
  Bash tool output from turn 2 (~40,000 tokens) was carried across 3 later requests (turns 2..=5) for ~120,000 carried tokens.
  evidence: tool=Bash, turns=2..=5, bytes=160,000 (measured), size=40,000 (estimated: utf8_bytes_div4_ceil_scaled), carried_turns=3, carried_cost=120,000 (estimated: utf8_bytes_div4_ceil_scaled; cache_read=80,000, cache_write=40,000, fresh_in=0)

=== claude-code/cache-miss-storm ===
[cache-miss-storm] turns=2..=4 (45,480 tokens, measured)
  3 mid-session requests on turns 2..=4 rewrote 45,480 prompt tokens into cache instead of hitting cache (likely mid-session model switch).
  evidence: turns=2..=4 (3 requests), rewritten=45,480 (measured), cache_read=0 (measured), likely_trigger=mid-session model switch

=== claude-code/heavy-overhead ===
[heavy-overhead] turns=1 (48,400 tokens, measured)
  First request on turn 1 started with 48,400 prompt tokens before conversation growth (~48,376 fixed overhead tokens).
  evidence: turn=1, P(1)=48,400 (measured), fixed_overhead=48,376 (estimated: utf8_bytes_div4_ceil_scaled); try `bentoctx budget`
